    "scenesThatPass": [
      "MARGOT: I'm Margot. Nice to meet you.\nELSA: Margot. Welcome. We'll endeavor to make your evening as pleasant as possible. Right this way.",
      "ANNE: We've seen it. Many times.\nELSA: Yes, you have, haven't you? The Liebrandts are very loyal customers.",
      "ELSA: Writing good things, I hope, Ms. Bloom. Not like what you wrote about our friends at Mercia.\nLILLIAN BLOOM: Mercia? Be fair, I wrote a very kind review of Mercia.\nELSA: Well not completely, Ms. Bloom.",
      "LINDA: Hello. Welcome.\nELSA: Miss...?\nMARGOT: Mills.\nELSA: Miss Mills. You will be sitting in Miss Westervelt's seat. Enjoy.",
      "MARGOT: Mmm. Longing and regret. My favorite.\nANNE: She's staring again."
    ]
  },
